No, never.

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:20.440
Neither do I. What's the matter with it?

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:24.680
You just see the odd Dalek hanging around the set and nobody doing anything to it.

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:28.160
Yes, but when they moved, there must have been a guy inside.

00:19:28.240 --> 00:19:28.640
Yes.

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:30.000
I don't think I ever met.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:40.030
a Dalek operator? Can you manage it? Put it over there. It's been said that Sabotsky always felt

