it the same fairy tale land

00:20:01.600 --> 00:20:03.030
that Sabotsky adored.

00:20:03.330 --> 00:20:05.570
You just see a little bit of one Dalek,

00:20:05.650 --> 00:20:06.830
don't you, inside?

00:20:07.530 --> 00:20:09.450
And this feeling,

00:20:09.550 --> 00:20:11.530
particularly among kids of that time,

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:14.430
that not to be too

