00:55:14.280 --> 00:55:19.140
still sitting behind the couch watching things I find that quite amazing that

00:55:19.140 --> 00:55:23.370
that much time has gone by since we did it really you have to see them at the

00:55:23.370 --> 00:55:30.000
cinema and the next best thing will be seeing them in widescreen to get the full picture and the fact

00:55:30.000 --> 00:55:35.240
that they're going to be out on video soon in widescreen would be wonderful.
